{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"9.11","type":"doc","updated":"20260911131825"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260911100209-i7yy4cv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-i7yy4cv","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hook注入"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-dex138v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-dex138v","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hook直译挂钩，本质是劫持程序原有函数执行流程，拦截函数调用，在目标函数执行前/后插入自己的代码\nHook注入：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把写的Hook钩子代码强行加载进目标进程，实现劫持目标程序内部函数的整套技术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n注入的目的，就是把写的Hook代码加载到目标进程的内存空间里，不然我们的代码在自己进程，根本碰不到目标程序"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-okgvtzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-okgvtzj","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原本程序调用流程：A函数--\u003eB函数（原逻辑）--\u003e结果\nHook劫持后：A函数--\u003e我的钩子代码--\u003e原B函数--\u003e后置自定义代码--\u003e结果"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-xtlh6u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-xtlh6u9","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合法正规用途"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-5i3zq9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-5i3zq9d","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"软件调试、逆向分析：拦截 API 调用，分析程序行为；\n安全软件：Hook 恶意进程读写文件、联网函数，拦截病毒行为；\n输入法、截图工具、键鼠全局监听、窗口翻译软件；\n游戏辅助工具（合法录制、键鼠宏）、软件界面美化。"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-fklfzp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-fklfzp6","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非法恶意用途（病毒 / 外挂）\n游戏外挂：Hook 游戏血量、坐标、发包函数，修改游戏数据、透视、自瞄；\n木马盗号：Hook 键盘输入函数，记录账号密码；Hook 网络发包，窃取传输数据；\n篡改软件逻辑、弹窗广告、劫持浏览器主页、注入进程绕过权限校验。"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-vec7aiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-vec7aiz","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"优点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n无需修改目标程序 EXE 本体，动态劫持，灵活可控；\n可以跨程序拦截系统全局行为，实现全局监听。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"缺点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n容易被反 Hook防护：\n游戏 EAC/BE、杀毒软件、进程保护会检测 Inline Hook、远程线程注入，直接判定非法行为并拦截、封号、报毒；\nInline Hook 容易出现栈不平衡、指令覆盖冲突，稳定性差。"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-ezno9rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-ezno9rr","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先说 IAT Hook。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"PE 导入表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是 PE 文件里一张记录外部函数信息的表\n程序调用 DLL 里的函数时，会从这张表里拿到函数真实内存地址\n所谓导入，就是进程加载 DLL 的时候，系统自动填充这张表里的函数地址\nIAT Hook 就是修改这张导入表，把表里原始函数地址替换成我们钩子函数地址，适合钩 DLL 导出函数\n实现简单，但不能钩程序内部函数"}]},{"ID":"20260911100209-q9tu3fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911100209-q9tu3fw","updated":"20260911100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"再讲 Inline Hook。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"直接修改目标函数入口的机器指令（通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"过目标函数的内存起始地址，直接读取进程内存，拿到开头的机器码"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n首先读取并备份目标函数开头几条原始指令，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在函数入口写入一条 jmp 跳转指令"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n让程序一进到这个函数，就跳到我们的 Hook 代码\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"被覆盖掉的原始指令，我们放到一块申请好的内存，做成跳板"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n等我们前置逻辑跑完，就执行跳板里备份的指令，再跳回原函数剩下代码继续跑\nInline Hook 通用性更强，任何函数都能钩，但是坑更多，要注意寄存器、栈平衡和多线程问题"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-qqs0vh8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-qqs0vh8","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"发起CDB请求怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-yvbx1st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-yvbx1st","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采用的是一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"两步式上传"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的设计\n首先，客户端"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"向服务端请求一个上传凭证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，服务端会生成一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"UUID4 随机 token"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在本地临时目录下创建一个以这个 token 命名的文件夹，然后把 token 和相关信息存到一个内存字典里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，返回给客户端一个上传 URL，格式就是 http://服务地址/uploads/{token}。"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-xq0pjws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-xq0pjws","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二步，客户端拿到这个 URL 之后，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" HTTP PUT 请求把文件流式上传到这个地址"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。服务端收到请求后，通过 URL 里的 token 去字典里查找，确认 token 有效、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"类型匹配，然后把文件流式写入到对应临时目录"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。上传完成后，根据类型做后续处理——dump 文件就计算 SHA1 做去重，符号文件就触发 symstore 索引入库。"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-8wa2kwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-8wa2kwz","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之所以设计成\"先获取 URL、再 PUT 上传\"而不是直接 POST 上传，主要考虑两点：\n一是支持大文件，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"PUT 方式可以流式写入磁盘，内存占用很小，我们支持最大 4GB 的文件；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n二是解耦，token 本身就是一次性凭证，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上传完成后立即失效并清理临时目录"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这样上传接口本身不需要维护状态，安全性也好"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-rewglpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-rewglpu","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简单来说就是：服务端生成一次性 token + 临时目录 → 客户端用这个 token 作为 PUT 目标上传文件 → 服务端校验 token 并处理文件。"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-ih1hmhl","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-ih1hmhl","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"# 1. 创建上传凭证\nPOST http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/uploads/create\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token\nBody: { \"file_type\": \"dump\" }\n\n# 返回：\n{\n  \"upload_url\": \"http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/uploads/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-...\",\n  \"method\": \"PUT\"\n}\n\n# 2. 上传文件\nPUT http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/uploads/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-...?filename=crash.dmp\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token\nBody: \u003c文件二进制流\u003e\n\n# 返回：\n{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"sha1\": \"abc123...\", \"size_bytes\": 1234567 }\n\n# 3. 查询 dump\nGET http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/dumps/abc123...\n\nPOST：我来创建一个新东西，你给我分配 ID\nPUT：我知道 ID 了，我把东西放到这个 ID 下面\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-6lp0tqq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-6lp0tqq","updated":"20260911125001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"dump上传怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-ry0pahd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-ry0pahd","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Starlette 的流式请求体"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"跑在 Uvicorn/ASGI 上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\nUvicorn 不攒全 body，而是一块块发 http.request 消息、用 more_body 标记还有没有；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Request.stream() "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把它转成异步生成器逐块 yield。\n我们 async for "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拿一块写一块盘，8MB 一块、写完就丢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，内存恒定 8MB，4GB 的 dump 也扛得住。"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-1ikfbh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-1ikfbh4","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"对比 request.body()：\n它不是另一套机制，内部就是把 stream 的每块 append 起来再 join，等于帮你攒全，所以才 OOM\n —— 用 stream 就是把控制权拿回自己手里。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-7cs0umc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-7cs0umc","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们额外做了两件事：边读边累加 size，超 4GB 立刻中断、删掉半截文件、返 413；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n以及先落 tmp 临时目录，等 SHA1 校验和归档都成功才 move 进正式仓库，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"传一半断掉的文件永远污染不了正式目录"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260911122159-bexiybv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911122159-bexiybv","updated":"20260911122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"短板是 f.write 和后续的 SHA1 计算都是同步阻塞 IO，\n卡在 async handler 里会拖慢事件循环，理想应该用 aiofiles 或者丢进 executor"}]},{"ID":"20260911125001-fsj7hxx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911125001-fsj7hxx","updated":"20260911131824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用关系"}]},{"ID":"20260911124959-p0z0y7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124959-p0z0y7l","updated":"20260911124959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入口层，就是 main.py，它负责把所有东西组装起来——创建 Starlette 应用、注册路由、配置 MCP server、启动 Uvicorn，相当于整个服务的\"总装配线\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260911124959-ueyo0dc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124959-ueyo0dc","updated":"20260911124959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"往下是接口层，同时暴露了两套接口：一套是 REST API，给脚本和自动化流程用的，走普通的 HTTP JSON 请求；另一套是 MCP 协议，给 AI agent 用的，走 JSON-RPC。两套接口功能一样，底层调的是同一套业务逻辑，只是入口不同。"}]},{"ID":"20260911124959-0164nlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124959-0164nlo","updated":"20260911124959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再往下是 Tools 工具层，这一层负责把核心功能包装成一个个独立的工具函数，比如上传、创建会话、执行命令。接口层（无论是 REST 还是 MCP）收到请求后，参数校验完就转发给 Tools 层，Tools 层做业务编排，比如上传工具里拼 URL、会话工具里展开预置命令。"}]},{"ID":"20260911124959-mpdw5sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124959-mpdw5sq","updated":"20260911124959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最底下是 Core 核心引擎层，这是真正干活的地方。file_manager 管文件存储和去重，session_manager 管会话生命周期和并发控制，cdb_session 管单个 CDB 调试进程的管道交互。Core 层通过 subprocess 调用外部的 cdb.exe 和 symstore.exe，同时从 Config 层读取所有配置参数——端口、路径、超时这些，其他层不直接读环境变量，都统一走 Config。"}]},{"ID":"20260911124959-kc2rhys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124959-kc2rhys","updated":"20260911124959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用关系是单向逐层依赖的：入口层组装一切，接口层接收请求转发给 Tools 层，Tools 层编排逻辑调 Core 层，Core 层执行业务读 Config、调外部程序。每一层只调它下一层，不跨层，这样职责清晰，改任何一层不影响其他层。"}]},{"ID":"20260911131824-2zbftce","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911131824-2zbftce","updated":"20260911131824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"REST API 是怎么搭建的？"}]},{"ID":"20260911131824-dbgfume","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131824-dbgfume","updated":"20260911131824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette 原生路由，没有用 FastAPI 这类高级框架\n每个接口就是一个 async def 函数，接收 Request 返回 JSONResponse\n通过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" Route 注册到路由列表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，最后在 main.py 里挂到 Starlette app 上"}]},{"ID":"20260911131824-v2anzpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131824-v2anzpb","updated":"20260911131824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"路由表是一组\nRoute(path, endpoint, methods) 的列表\n比如 Route(\"/api/uploads/create\", endpoint=api_create_upload, methods=[\"POST\"])\nStarlette 启动时把所有路由注册进去，收到请求后根据 URL 路径 + HTTP 方法去匹配路由表\n找到对应的 endpoint 函数执行"}]},{"ID":"20260911131824-psnmtyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131824-psnmtyz","updated":"20260911131824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整个 REST API 层代码很薄\n每个 handler 就是解析参数 → 调 MCP tool 函数 → 包 JSON 返回，业务逻辑全在 tools/core 层\nMCP tool 和 REST API 共享同一套核心逻辑，改一个地方两边都生效"}]},{"ID":"20260911131824-8tpa3uv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911131824-8tpa3uv","updated":"20260911131825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个 REST 请求从进入到返回经历了什么？以 POST /api/uploads/create 为例"}]},{"ID":"20260911131824-sx2ke9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131824-sx2ke9b","updated":"20260911131824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"路由匹配："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette 遍历路由表，匹配 Route(\"/api/uploads/create\", endpoint=api_create_upload, methods=[\"POST\"])，调 api_create_upload(request)\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"参数解析："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"await request.json() 解析请求体，校验 file_type\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"调业务函数："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"upload_tools.upload(\"dump\") → file_manager.create_upload_token() 生成 UUID + 创建 tmp/{token}/ 目录 + 存内存字典\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"返回响应："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果经 _api_upload_url() 改写 URL 路径，包装成 JSONResponse 返回"}]},{"ID":"20260911131825-c51n7ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131825-c51n7ps","updated":"20260911131825"}}]}